  <div class="hero-in">
    <h1><span class="ln"><span>Solar infrastructure</span></span><span class="ln"><span>for industry.</span></span></h1>
    <div class="side">
      <p class="lede">Engineering, financing and operation of solar PV for factories, warehouses and commercial estates in Malaysia.</p>
      <div class="acts"><a class="btn btn--light" href="#contact">Request a site assessment</a><a class="tlink" href="https://pub-31ab1252a5544ca19749b476315d9b01.r2.dev/pr-attachments/041d2d8a-07b3-4c6a-9895-9d9f2a2f2bd9/Eternalgy_Corporate_Profile_v4_Full.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Company profile (PDF)</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="stats wrap" aria-labelledby="stats-h">
    <h2 id="stats-h" class="h-head"><span class="soft">Three years.</span><br>Twelve megawatts.</h2>
    <div class="ledger num">
      <div class="row"><span class="w">12</span><span class="c"><b>MWp+</b> of solar PV installed and commissioned</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="w">1,100</span><span class="c"><b>+</b> projects delivered across Malaysia</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="w">35</span><span class="c"><b>RM million+</b> in customer revenue since 2023</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span class="w">G7</span><span class="c"><b>CIDB grade</b>, the highest, with unlimited tender capacity</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="caps wrap" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="caps-h">
    <h2 id="caps-h" class="h-head">Capabilities</h2>
    <div class="group">
      <h3>Engineering and construction</h3>
      <ul>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Full EPC for metal-deck and concrete roofs: structural assessment, design, supply, installation and grid connection.">Rooftop EPC</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Ground-mounted arrays on industrial land, on our own mounting engineering.">Ground-mount systems</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Solar carports and covered walkways for business parks and car parks.">Carports</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="LV switchgear, cabling and TNB bi-directional interconnection by our in-house electrical team.">Electrical works</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Connection Assessment and Power System Studies prepared and submitted to TNB for larger systems.">TNB CAS and PSS studies</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sum">Rooftop, ground-mount and carport EPC with our own electrical team and TNB studies.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="group">
      <h3>Financing</h3>
      <ul>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="We finance, build and operate the system; you buy the electricity at a rate below the tariff. No capital outlay.">Zero-capex PPA</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Approved on SEDA's Registered PV Investor directory to own and operate systems on your premises.">SEDA RPVI investor</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Preferred installer for Maybank's solar financing products.">Maybank financing</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="MyHijau-certified equipment (MyHS00025/25) qualifies outright purchases for the 60% Green Investment Tax Allowance.">60% GITA allowance</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sum">Zero-capex PPA, bank financing and the 60% GITA tax allowance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="group">
      <h3>Operations</h3>
      <ul>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Preventive maintenance, cleaning and thermal inspection on a fixed schedule.">O&amp;M contracts</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="Inverter-level monitoring with monthly performance reports against the design yield.">Performance monitoring</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="One number to call; the engineers who built the system respond to faults.">Fault response</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="SAJ battery storage for peak shaving and backup, with SHRDC-trained technicians.">Battery storage</li>
        <li tabindex="0" data-d="AC and DC charging for fleets and staff, integrated with on-site generation.">EV charging</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="sum">O&amp;M contracts, performance reporting, storage and EV charging.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="cap-note" id="capnote" aria-live="polite">Select a capability for the scope we deliver.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sectors wrap" id="sectors" aria-labelledby="sec-h">
    <div class="side">
      <h2 id="sec-h" class="h-head">Sectors</h2>
      <div class="shot"><img id="shot" src="/images/b2b/aerial-factory.webp" alt="Manufacturing plant with a fully covered solar roof" width="1600" height="1067" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="slist" id="slist">
      <div class="srow" tabindex="0" data-img="/images/b2b/aerial-factory.webp" data-alt="Manufacturing plant with a fully covered solar roof"><div><h3>Manufacturing plants</h3><p>High daytime load and large metal-deck roofs: the fastest payback in the portfolio.</p></div><span class="k">EPC · PPA</span></div>
      <div class="srow" tabindex="0" data-img="/images/b2b/aerial-warehouse.webp" data-alt="Logistics warehouse roof covered with solar modules"><div><h3>Logistics and warehousing</h3><p>Long, unobstructed roofs and cold-chain loads, built around live operations.</p></div><span class="k">EPC · O&amp;M</span></div>
      <div class="srow" tabindex="0" data-img="/images/b2b/aerial-commercial.webp" data-alt="Commercial complex with rooftop solar and a solar carport"><div><h3>Commercial property</h3><p>Rooftops and carports for offices, retail and mixed-use estates.</p></div><span class="k">EPC · Carport</span></div>
      <div class="srow" tabindex="0" data-img="/images/b2b/aerial-cold-storage.webp" data-alt="Food processing and cold storage facility with rooftop solar"><div><h3>Food processing and cold storage</h3><p>Round-the-clock refrigeration paired with solar and battery storage.</p></div><span class="k">EPC · BESS</span></div>
      <div class="srow" tabindex="0" data-img="/images/b2b/aerial-industrial-park.webp" data-alt="Industrial park at dusk with a large solar roof"><div><h3>Industrial parks</h3><p>Multi-tenant estates under one engineering and operations contract.</p></div><span class="k">PPA · O&amp;M</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="process wrap" id="process" aria-labelledby="proc-h">
    <h2 id="proc-h" class="h-head">From feasibility to handover</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step"><figure><img src="/images/b2b/step-feasibility.webp" alt="Engineer measuring a factory roof" loading="lazy" width="1067" height="1600"></figure><h3>Feasibility</h3><p>Roof survey, load profile from twelve months of TNB data, yield and payback model.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><figure><img src="/images/b2b/step-design.webp" alt="Single-line diagram and roof layout drawings" loading="lazy" width="1067" height="1600"></figure><h3>Engineering design</h3><p>Structural check, string layout and single-line diagram, signed off in-house.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><figure><img src="/images/b2b/step-approvals.webp" alt="Engineer testing a main switchboard" loading="lazy" width="1067" height="1600"></figure><h3>Approvals</h3><p>SEDA submission as a registered RPVSP, TNB studies and interconnection.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><figure><img src="/images/b2b/step-construction.webp" alt="Crane lifting solar modules onto a factory roof" loading="lazy" width="1067" height="1600"></figure><h3>Construction</h3><p>Our own crews under an OSH-C certified supervisor. No sub-contractors.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><figure><img src="/images/b2b/step-commissioning.webp" alt="Engineer inspecting a wall of string inverters" loading="lazy" width="1067" height="1600"></figure><h3>Commissioning</h3><p>Testing, SEDA approval and the TNB bi-directional meter. Handover dossier.</p></article>
      <article class="step"><figure><img src="/images/b2b/step-om.webp" alt="Technician inspecting modules with a thermal camera" loading="lazy" width="1067" height="1600"></figure><h3>Operation</h3><p>Monitoring, thermal inspection and cleaning for the life of the system.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="band-h">
    <img src="/images/b2b/aerial-warehouse.webp" alt="Aerial view of a warehouse roof covered in solar modules" loading="lazy" width="1600" height="1067">
    <div class="cap">
      <h2 id="band-h" class="h-head">Built, commissioned,<br>and running.</h2>
      <p>Over 12 MWp across more than 1,100 projects, maintained by the team that built them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="creds wrap" id="credentials" aria-labelledby="cred-h">
    <h2 id="cred-h" class="h-head"><span>Top grade,</span><span>on record.</span></h2>
    <table class="rv">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td class="num">2026</td><td>CIDB Grade G7, unlimited tender capacity</td><td>CIDB Malaysia · B04, CE21, M15</td><td class="num">0120250324-WP152634</td></tr>
